/*  hole-11-26576.cufe: the model says some run reaches freed memory; `check` accepts it.
    chance true: CRASH 0xc0000005; chance false: CRASH 0xc0000005  */

Define chance as true permanently.
Bind series of number to f0, given (the series of number p0):
    p0 becomes a series of number.
    Pull a rabbit.
        If chance:
            Pull a rabbit.
                Define v1 as p0.
            Done.
        Done.
        Otherwise:
            p0 becomes p0.
        Done.
    Done.
    Return p0.
Done.
Pull a rabbit.
    Pull a rabbit.
        If chance:
            Define v2 as a series of number.
        Done.
        Otherwise:
            Define v3 as a series of number.
        Done.
    Done.
Done.
Define v4 as a series of number.
Pull a rabbit.
    Define v5 as a series of series of number.
Done.
Pull a rabbit.
    v4 becomes cast f0 on (v4).
Done.
v4 becomes v4.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State v4.
